    "tree_id": "ab2ccfea55f376d0138514eb3e58f4bc00aae045",
    "message": "[ipa-delivery:722] build(delivery): request the private common IPA 722 again (first attempt stopped at the transport split: the encrypted IPA passed 4 x 64 MiB; fixed and refrozen)\n\nRefrozen manifest build-utils/delivery/722.json on the delivered 721 (freeze\ncommit b0305c6a, effective digest 2528a3dc, seven reviewed commits: the six of\nthe first request and the transport fix ea8152d9). Same components: RPCS3 Core\n920 pin f9f2b478, MeloNX Core 721 pin 784fcc5d with MeloNXMoltenVKStandalone\n6f65b2a6, the MeloNX stall watch, skins PR 169. First request (run\n42848698413): preflight, republish, flutter and native green, the application\nbuilt and sealed; build-utils/split_encrypted_delivery.py refused the\nencrypted payload over 256 MiB. The fix is a product path, so both groups run\nfresh again. Delivery contract 63 tests OK (4 skipped), contract 722 passed\n(offline), trigger paths accepted.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_012mUAShv9k6pSCnpW7oAF63",
    "timestamp": "2026-11-10T16:17:00Z",
